These are the pains which only your Jesus can calculate. He's the only one who went through them.

320
00:58:46.000 --> 00:58:59.000
But in certain circumstances, they are necessary to me so much so that I am forced to hide you more within me so as not to let you feel all the bitterness of the pain.

321
00:58:59.000 --> 00:59:16.000
So he says certain circumstances, these are the really bad times. He says he has to hide Louisa more deeply within him so that she actually feels all the bitterness of pain.

322
00:59:16.000 --> 00:59:32.000
And while I hide you notice she hasn't gone anywhere and he hasn't gone anywhere, the union remains. I repeat, he said, what my humanity did and suffered.

323
00:59:32.000 --> 00:59:46.000
So Jesus is acting in and through Louisa all the time, she just needs to come to understand more deeply the extraordinary nature of what's happening to her.

324
