347
01:02:52.000 --> 01:02:54.000
Well, that's the story of footprints.

348
01:02:54.000 --> 01:03:01.000
That you walk together with the Lord, and then there's only one set of footprints, and when times are bad, he carries you.

349
01:03:01.000 --> 01:03:05.000
